<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Come and tell your troubles to them, open up.</l><l>Come and tell your troubles to them, open up.</l><l>Let them know how you are feeling,</l><l>For you know that they are caring</l><l>About everything you’re sharing, open up.</l></lg>
</div>
